        : CMP. DONE
        : DSC. N/A
        Jabhog
        : CMP. DONE
        : DSC. Charge those points up, then...zing! Let 'em fly! Jabhog is famous in the new world for its spiky spines. They were short and cute when it was young, but they eventually grew into dangerous needles. It'll jab anything that gets too close, so approach with caution!
